WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:02.300
<i>Soccer.</i>

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:06.280
<i>The sport loved by people around the world.</i>

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.420
<i>Those with footwork as sharp as a sword</i>

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:12.240
<i>and those who pass the ball like magic</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.630
<i>shake the stadium with the enthusiasm 
they evoke from their fans.</i>

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.870
<i>Yet, not matter how long 
you control the game for,</i>

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.450
<i>without scoring a goal you can never win.</i>

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.930
<i>Therefore, Japan was searching for a knight</i>

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:28.990
<i>in the penalty area with the 
absolute power to decide the game.</i>

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:02.700
The fifteen-and-under 
U-15 Japan/South America Cup,

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.410
Japan versus Brazil!

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:10.730
We're nearing two minutes of 
loss time here in the second half.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:14.330
The score is 1-2, Brazil's lead.

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:16.590
Japan is feeling the pressure.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:19.330
They've got to find some 
way of tying up the game.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.720
However, Brazil isn't 
letting up on the attack.

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.020
They're pushing. Pushing.

