<b>I</b>

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:24.310
<b>I l</b>

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:24.430
<b>I li</b>

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:24.560
<b>I lik</b>

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:24.680
<b>I like</b>

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:24.770
<b>I like s</b>

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:24.930
<b>I like so</b>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:25.060
<b>I like soc</b>

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:25.180
<b>I like socc</b>

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:25.310
<b>I like socce</b>

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.980
<b>I like soccer</b>

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.010
I like soccer.

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:41.550
It's Aizawa!

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:45.290
Japan's number 10, the king 
of the field, Suguru Aizawa!

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:48.020
He took advantage of that momentary 
opportunity and stole possession!

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:56.920
<b>I</b>

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:57.050
<b>I re</b>

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:57.170
<b>I real</b>

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:57.300
<b>I reall</b>

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:57.420
<b>I really</b>

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:57.510
<b>I really li</b>

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:58.300
<b>I really like</b>

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:00.300
I really like soccer.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:58.430
<b>I really like s</b>

00:01:58.430 --> 00:01:58.550
<b>I really like soc</b>

00:01:58.550 --> 00:01:58.680
<b>I really like socc</b>

00:01:58.680 --> 00:01:58.800
<b>I really like socce</b>

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:03.240
<b>I really like soccer</b>

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:05.310
He's broken into a dribble.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:08.040
<i>The speed to suddenly switch 
the defense into offense.</i>

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.660
He's broken past the first defender!

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:10.660
The second!

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.370
<i>The magnificent footwork of a breakthrough.</i>

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:17.110
<i>Closing tens of meters into</i>

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:21.520
<i>nothing in an instant with 
a magical through pass.</i>

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:35.530
<i>And a shot like a flash.</i>

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:42.450
GOAL!

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:47.060
Japan manages to tie up the score 
before the end of the half!

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.150
And the one who made the 
shot was, of course,

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:57.020
none other than the unstoppable 
ace, Suguru Aizawa.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:02.520
<i>My name is Kakeru Aizawa.</i>

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:12.740
<i>I'm Suguru Aizawa's younger brother.</i>

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:53.930
<b><i>I Like Soccer</i></b>

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:13.450
<b>Kamakura Middle School</b>

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.960
Here comes Suguru.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.560
He takes advantage of that momentary 
opportunity and steals possession.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:26.720
Those who couldn't make it 
to the game: pay attention.

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:25.330
Brazil's defense is closing in, 
but he slips past one

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:28.680
and then the other with 
his magnificent footwork.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.640
Whoa!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.930
Finally, as if the ball was pulled in 
by a string, a gorgeous through pass!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:46.490
Are you okay, Kakeru?

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:47.450
Hey!

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.800
Practice has already started.

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:55.200
Kakeru! If you're playing around 
because you're the manager,

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:57.210
just quit the club.

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:01.290
My bad, brother.
I mean, I'm sorry, Captain.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:13.510
<i>My brother is amazing.</i>

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.180
<i>He's known as Japan's prize.</i>

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:21.810
Suguru-senpai!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.830
Wow! He looked over here!

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.550
<i>Comparing my brother to me,</i>

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:31.160
<i>would be like comparing 
the moon to a turtle.</i>

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.330
Damn it!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:43.210
Here's your jersey.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:43.790
Thanks.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.340
Here's a towel.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.430
Thanks.

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.870
Hey, Manager!

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:48.720
Yes!

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:50.260
Kakeru-kun!

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.260
Um!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.260
Could you...?

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.110
To my brother, right?

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:55.760
I'll pass it on.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.120
Switch it up!

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:00.940
Kakeru.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:04.210
What are you doing? 
Leave that for the first years.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:05.570
It's fine. It's fine.

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:09.070
At least let me help you out.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.720
I'm really okay.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:12.660
Hey! Aizawa!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.340
Which Aizawa?

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:16.370
The lower quality one, obviously!

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:18.700
He didn't just say...

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:19.990
What is it?

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:21.330
Kakeru!

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:24.150
Can you get me my shin guards?

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:25.320
On it!

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:26.940
Kota, can you take care of this?

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:27.620
What?

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:30.450
Whoa! Hey!

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:41.790
Hey, Kakeru.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:45.900
When you saw your brother's 
amazing play in the Brazil game,

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.550
didn't it remind you of anything?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.610
Up until last year you 
played as a forward, right?

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:55.280
Quit being a manager and be a player again!

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.470
Exactly.

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.820
If you could use your left a little more,

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.590
you'd be able to match up against me.

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:04.490
Even if I turned my world upside down,

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:07.040
I wouldn't be able to play like my brother.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:11.760
If my brother continues as a player, 
I'll continue as a manager.

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:14.970
Someday, I'll start studying to be a trainer.

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:23.190
When the genius, Suguru Aizawa,

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.960
stands on the World Cup soccer field,

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:29.020
my dream is to stand there, too.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:32.740
I'll be my brother's manager and his trainer.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:39.010
Whether that's manly or not...

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:41.370
Yuusuke, sub in. 
Get in there.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:42.200
Okay!

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:43.660
Go get 'em!

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:51.050
Well, I guess that's one way to live.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:02.750
C'mon! It's Yuusuke every single time!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.110
It can't be helped.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:06.700
Of all the second years,
 he's definitely the best.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:09.520
Man! It must be nice to be the manager.

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:13.920
Meanwhile, I'm all nervous for 
tomorrow's red and white match.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.050
It is the regular selection match, after all.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.960
Dear God and Buddha!

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:21.420
Please let someone have a
 stomachache so I can play!

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.840
"To curse someone is to 
dig two holes," right?

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.000
How strange.

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:42.630
Hey, hey, hey!

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:44.450
I haven't seen your uniform 
around here before.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.990
This is a no trespassing zone!

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:50.190
Do you want to be legally 
sexually harassed, huh?

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:56.570
Kakeru.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.500
Kakeru, long time no see.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:02.980
Why... do you know my name?

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:04.620
How cute!

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:07.710
I transferred to this school.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.190
I've come back to Kamakura.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.830
Um...

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:14.050
I guess you don't recognize me.

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:20.470
Um, I'm sorry. I, uh...

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:22.750
I'm Seven.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:27.140
Seven? Uh, huh? Seven...

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:31.190
S-Seven?!

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:34.990
Hey! Quit slacking off!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.690
Kakeru, nice header.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.540
Suguru-san's the same as always.

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:49.120
Reminds me of our elementary school team.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.500
Suguru-san was the leader,

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.620
and you and I were the top two.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.410
Kakeru, you don't play soccer anymore?

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.510
What a waste. 
You should play.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:04.520
I'd love to see the Suguru-Kakeru 
combination again.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.180
Or don't you like soccer anymore?

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.990
I love soccer, of course,

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:17.900
but...

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:23.870
Oh! I have to go to the staff room.

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:25.260
See you later, Kakeru.

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:26.330
Yeah.

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:30.610
I'm going to be the soccer 
club's manager as well.

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:33.500
So as manager to manager,
 I look forward to working with you.

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:35.330
See you!

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:41.740
Manager to manager?

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.650
I'd like to introduce our transfer student.

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:56.070
<b><i>Nana Mishima</i></b>

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.210
Nana Mishima-kun.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:02.530
I'm Mishima from Los Angeles. 
Nice to meet you.

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:09.790
The first real hot girl 
this class has ever had!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.930
She's an angel! 
An angel has descended!

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:15.170
What a relaxing aura!
I can feel the negative ions!

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:16.730
Wait a minute, boys!

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:17.630
What exactly does that mean?

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.590
Your seat is next to Aizawa.

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:21.390
What do you think, Kakeru?

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:22.920
Does it suit me?

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.260
No honorifics?

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.490
You know her?

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.470
Uh...

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.770
We're childhood friends.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.760
<i>Nana Mishima.</i>

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:43.970
<i>When we were in elementary 
school, she was a forward</i>

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:46.280
<i>on the same soccer team that 
my brother and I were on.</i>

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:50.200
<i>We called her "Seven" as 
a translation of "Nana."</i>

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:51.410
Kakeru!

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:56.600
<i>Back then she was tall 
and looked like a boy.</i>

00:12:58.740 --> 00:12:59.750
<i>But...</i>

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:06.680
<i>In the summer of fifth grade, 
her parents had to move to America</i>

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:10.140
<i>and she came to say 
goodbye to the team.</i>

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.120
<i>At that moment,</i>

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:17.460
<i>as I was looking at her,
 I realized that I had come to like her.</i>

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.630
<i>But Seven...</i>

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.400
Suguru-san!

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.180
Suguru-senpai!

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:30.200
Suguru-san!

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:31.460
Hey.

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:41.690
Soccer Club 
Entry Form

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:03.190
Whoa!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.860
Kakeru, where are you going?

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.480
To the convenience store.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.210
At this time of night?

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:11.990
I have to buy powdered sports drink.

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:14.950
Are you enjoying being a 
manager that much, Kakeru?

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.410
What? Where's this coming from?

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.560
Um, well, I'm off.

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:25.250
You really irritate me.

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.470
Always running away.

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.230
What's wrong?

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:32.180
You've been acting weird recently, brother.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.430
Something bothering you?

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.750
No way, right?

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:37.250
There's no way something could

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:38.850
be bothering the great Suguru Aizawa—

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.610
What do you know about me?

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:50.360
What does someone who just 
runs away know about me?

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.500
Hey, Sugu-nii, what are you doing?

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:01.950
Stop messing around.

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:04.940
When did you turn into that kind of person?

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:20.550
You idiot.

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:58.180
<i>I wonder how many months it's been...</i>

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:03.370
<i>Since I stopped kicking a ball 
in front of anyone else.</i>

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:04.940
Here I go!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.520
Nice return.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:14.450
<i>Since I started kicking around a ball 
in this park at night by myself.</i>

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:21.260
The last pass from the slide goes 
to Kakeru Aizawa's direct left!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:28.820
He traps it and shoots with his right!

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.050
All right! Goal!

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:54.990
An alien?

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.500
Grey?

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:24.180
<i>Who is this really suspicious character?</i>

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.810
U-um, that ball...

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:29.690
Hey! Wait!

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:51.670
<i>A-amazing! 
Footwork like a whirlwind.</i>

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.010
<i>Along with that trap earlier,</i>

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.320
<i>this grey-masked character is good.</i>

00:17:58.050 --> 00:17:59.260
<i>He wants me to come get it?</i>

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:02.280
<i>And he's being really persistent about it.</i>

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:04.370
<i>All right.</i>

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:06.100
<i>I'll do it!</i>

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:13.930
<i>My left!</i>

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.220
Shoot!

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.520
I won't let you get away!

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.170
<i>My left again.</i>

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:42.390
<i>This guy knows I can't use my left.</i>

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:46.040
<i>Okay, this time...</i>

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:55.960
<i>He's good.
This alien is no amateur.</i>

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:58.330
<i>But who could it be?</i>

00:18:58.710 --> 00:18:59.720
<i>Kota?</i>

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:00.860
<i>No, Yuusuke?</i>

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:01.870
<i>Could it be my brother?</i>

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:06.170
<i>No, I don't care who it is.</i>

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:11.510
<i>I always have the most fun 
when I play soccer, after all!</i>

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:33.990
I don't know... who you are...

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:38.990
but come again!

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:41.460
Let's play soccer again.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:01.880
Oh! It's almost time for the 
regular selection match!

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:05.240
I don't care if I'm on the bench,
 just let me on the team!

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:07.850
Hey, Yuusuke, what were you up to last night?

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:11.230
Playing a soccer video game at home. Why?

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:14.940
What do you think of when 
I say "a park at night"?

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.090
What?

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:18.670
If you're asking about 
a peeping tom, try Kota.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:20.490
Hey. I wasn't peeping.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:23.820
But if you went peeping, 
why didn't you invite me?!

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.370
Kakeru!

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:28.490
Did you see these?

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.200
Or was it this?

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:32.670
Or maybe both?!

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:42.740
You guys really have no 
sense of anxiety, do you?

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:45.490
Hey, Nakatsuka,

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:50.090
keep to the edge of the field 
so you don't get in my way.

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.500
Well, that's if you even get on the field.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:55.480
Nishijima! I'll kill you!

00:20:57.910 --> 00:20:59.440
Everyone assemble.

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:02.900
The regular selection match will now begin.

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:06.360
As you know, because of Ishikawa's 
unfortunate injury,

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:11.370
three second years will be 
joining the bench this year.

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:12.920
Kunimatsu.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:15.830
When I call your name, respond loudly.

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:20.200
First on defense, Kota Nakatsuka.

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:22.300
Yes! Yes, yes, yes!

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:23.390
Kota!

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:25.060
For midfield, Manabu Endou.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:25.960
Yes!

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:28.720
Finally... hmm?

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.140
Playing forward,

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:34.890
Kakeru Aizawa.

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:36.810
Really?

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:38.250
What?!

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:38.980
Huh?

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:41.950
Kakeru Aizawa, where's your response?

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:43.790
Oh, yes, here!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:44.950
Kakeru!

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.950
Why was I...

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:48.980
You three, head to the UP.

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:51.870
W-wait a minute.
 I'm the mana—

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.620
I decided it.

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:55.500
Hurry up and change.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:57.250
You're wearing red for the sub team.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.730
This is absurd!

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:00.410
Why?

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:02.760
Are you afraid you'll embarrass yourself?

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:06.930
Are you a manager because you 
don't want to be embarrassed?

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:09.480
No! I want pursue a manager's—

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:11.670
More excuses, Kakeru?

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:18.030
You're just scared of showing your 
true self in front of other people.

00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:20.810
You don't even have the balls to 
quit soccer completely.

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:23.060
That's why you ran away 
to the manager's position.

00:22:23.430 --> 00:22:25.280
Am I wrong, Kakeru?

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:28.170
<i>Kakeru's... true self?</i>

00:22:29.230 --> 00:22:32.320
If you can't listen to the captain's 
orders, quit the soccer club.

00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:33.490
That's all.

00:22:33.890 --> 00:22:35.530
The selection match is in ten minutes.

00:22:35.850 --> 00:22:37.050
Stay hydrated.

00:22:37.050 --> 00:22:38.200
Okay!

00:22:40.490 --> 00:22:42.040
I didn't run away.

00:22:42.480 --> 00:22:46.550
What does someone who just 
runs away know about me?

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:50.010
I didn't run.

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:52.670
I...

00:22:53.510 --> 00:22:54.470
I...

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:57.660
Seriously! Why was the 
manager chosen to play?!

00:22:57.660 --> 00:22:58.620
What's going on?

00:22:58.620 --> 00:22:59.440
Who knows?

00:22:59.950 --> 00:23:02.030
It doesn't feel right.

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:03.140
Man...

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:05.010
Kakeru...

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:06.570
I'll play.

00:23:07.680 --> 00:23:10.110
I'll freaking play, damn it!

00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:12.490
Yuusuke, come with me to the UP.

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:13.330
Okay.

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:15.360
Hurry up.

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:23.190
<i>To be honest, I was frustrated.</i>

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:27.000
<i>I was seriously pissed off.</i>

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:30.270
<i>But at the same time,</i>

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:35.760
<i>my heart was fluttering.</i>

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:38.370
<i>It may have been just for a moment,</i>

00:23:38.780 --> 00:23:44.390
<i>but to be able to run 
around this field again</i>

00:23:46.100 --> 00:23:47.490
<i>with my brother...</i>

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:49.770
<i>That hope...</i>

00:23:57.730 --> 00:23:58.780
Here, Kakeru.

00:23:59.170 --> 00:23:59.910
Thank you.

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey, Kakeru, look.

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:04.880
Suguru-san's wearing a red jersey, too.

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:07.090
You're both on the sub team.

00:24:14.120 --> 00:24:14.860
Bow!

00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:17.640
Thank you for the game!

00:24:19.220 --> 00:24:21.100
<i>But I didn't know</i>

00:24:25.160 --> 00:24:27.130
<i>that to play on the same 
team as my brother...</i>

00:24:28.530 --> 00:24:30.300
<i>to run on the field with him...</i>

00:24:33.190 --> 00:24:34.380
<i>that this day...</i>

00:24:36.180 --> 00:24:37.870
<i>would be the last time.</i>

00:24:42.770 --> 00:24:44.610
Kick off!

00:24:45.940 --> 00:25:15.380
<b>Next time: The Knight in the Area</b>

00:24:48.420 --> 00:24:51.750
Kakeru, who never could use his left leg...

00:24:52.430 --> 00:24:53.380
Just one more.

00:24:53.760 --> 00:24:55.550
That unattainable one more.

00:24:56.280 --> 00:25:00.450
Even so, his brother still 
sends every pass seriously.

00:25:01.040 --> 00:25:02.640
The pass of his soul.

00:25:03.010 --> 00:25:05.090
Next time on The Knight in the Area:

00:25:05.350 --> 00:25:07.860
the second episode,
 "The Knight in the Area."

00:25:09.110 --> 00:25:10.240
Suguru-san,

00:25:10.240 --> 00:25:12.850
what do you hope for in Kakeru?
